Subject: [PATCH 4/7] test(tools): pin the checks of directly built insert,
 seat and connection values

The #4096 review found that a component accepted insert and seat specs
with invalid public fields, and that a typed connection code that is
not in its text form did not fit its canonical twin. These tests pin
the refusals by position and the normalization.

